1. Removed the reference to the missing "create-new-team-view" since it's not needed in this component
2. Added QueryClientProvider and SessionProvider to handle data fetching and authentication
3. Created a new QueryClient instance
4. Kept the error boundary and suspense for proper error handling
5. Maintained the dynamic import of the platform members page component

The error was caused by trying to import a non-existent file. Since we're working with the platform members page component, we don't need the teams-related imports that were causing the error.

